  //     clicks and tries to resolve /api/ as one of ITS pages, which
  //     silently does nothing. The URL was always right; the click
  //     never landed. _blank is the documented opt-out.
  //   - /index.html, not the bare directory — `vitepress dev` has no
  //     directory-index fallback for public/ subdirectories, so /api/
  //     returns the empty SPA shell locally while /api/index.html
  //     serves the real page. A static host resolves both, so the
  //     explicit file is the form that works everywhere.
  // The href stays RELATIVE so it is correct under the project base
